        <h3>Fixing of the cables in the cabinet</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>To protect the <span data-field="cable_size_1">{{ cable_size_1 }}</span> load cables (L1, L2, L3, N) from damage, in case of a short circuit or while transportation, the wires shall be fixed as shown in Fig.14</li>
