        </ul>
        <img src="placeholder_image_2.png" alt="Cable connection for the MCB on the DIN rail" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="figure-caption">Fig.15: <span data-field="figure_caption_2">{{ figure_caption_2 }}</span></div>
